---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Updates — DroidDeck Guide"
  description="DroidDeck release notes translated and summarized, plus community bug roundups for every new version."
  page="updates"

  locale="en"
>
  <style>
    .page-header{background:var(--night);color:white;padding:90px 0 50px}
    .page-header h1{font-size:42px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .page-header p{color:#93a7ba;max-width:600px}
    .page-content{padding:50px 0 80px}
    .timeline{display:grid;gap:24px}
    .release{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:28px}
    .release-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;gap:20px;margin-bottom:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .release h2{font-size:22px;margin:0}
    .release .date{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
    .release .tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#f0f7fc;color:#147cb9;margin-left:10px}
    .release-section{margin-top:18px}
    .release-section h4{font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px}
    .release-section ul{font-size:13px;color:#43576c;line-height:1.9;margin:0}
    .release-section li{margin:6px 0}
    .bugs h4{color:#d97706}
    .bugs ul li::marker{color:#d97706}
    .fixes h4{color:#16a34a}
    .fixes ul li::marker{color:#16a34a}
    .notes h4{color:#147cb9}
    .notes ul li::marker{color:#147cb9}
    .subscribe{background:#f4f7fa;border-radius:10px;padding:28px;margin-top:40px}
    .subscribe h3{margin-bottom:8px}
    .subscribe p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px}
    .subscribe-form{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .subscribe-form input{flex:1;min-width:220px;padding:11px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;font-size:14px}
    .subscribe-form button{background:var(--blue);color:#041d31;border:0;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:5px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}
  </style>
  
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-label"><span></span> Updates</div>
        <h1>Release notes &amp; bug roundups</h1>
        <p>We translate DroidDeck changelogs and collect community reports so you know what's fixed, what's new, and what might break before you update.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-content wrap">
      <div class="timeline">
        <article class="release">
          <div class="release-header">
            <div>
              <h2>DroidDeck 0.x.x</h2>
              <span class="date">Released November 2026 · Updated 2 days ago</span>
            </div>
            <span class="tag">Latest</span>
          </div>
          <div class="release-section fixes">
            <h4>What's fixed</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Improved controller detection for certain Bluetooth gamepads.</li>
              <li>Reduced audio latency on Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 devices.</li>
              <li>Steam Big Picture now scales correctly on 1080p handheld screens.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="release-section notes">
            <h4>What's new</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Experimental Mali GPU support (unstable).</li>
              <li>New performance overlay options.</li>
              <li>Optional desktop environment updated to newer base.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="release-section bugs">
            <h4>Reported bugs</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Some users see a black screen when launching DX12 titles on Adreno 650.</li>
              <li>Cloud save sync may fail on first login for some Steam accounts.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="release">
          <div class="release-header">
            <h2>DroidDeck 0.x.x-1</h2>
            <span class="date">Released October 2026 · Updated 2 weeks ago</span>
          </div>
          <div class="release-section fixes">
            <h4>What's fixed</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Resolved force-close when switching apps during game download.</li>
              <li>Fixed keyboard input not registering in some launchers.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="release-section notes">
            <h4>What's new</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>FSR 3 frame generation preview.</li>
              <li>Initial support for external display output on select devices.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="subscribe">
        <h3>Get update alerts</h3>
        <p>We'll send a short summary whenever a new DroidDeck version drops and we've finished our bug roundup.</p>
        <form class="subscribe-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();alert('Thanks! This is a demo form.');">
          <input type="email" placeholder="your@email.com" required aria-label="Email address">
          <button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
  
  
</Layout>
